 "description": "<p>A mystery box built for the indecisive: full lingerie outfits, leather collars, toys, and other items from the catalog, at a per-piece cost well under list price. Three box sizes run 5, 7, and 10 pieces, and three size bands run S (40-50 kg), M (50-60 kg), and L (60-70 kg).</p>\n<p>Contents include items not yet released on the site, which is the gamble and the fun of the format. Every box is packed to its piece count - the floor is the count you choose, not a maybe.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Contents: lingerie sets, collars, toys, and catalog surprises</li>\n<li>Piece counts: 5, 7, or 10 per box</li>\n<li>Sizing: S (40-50 kg), M (50-60 kg), L (60-70 kg)</li>\n<li>Note: intimate items, non-returnable once opened</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Pick piece count and size band at checkout. If choosing is the hard part, this listing exists to skip it.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Mystery lingerie box in 5, 7 or 10 pieces with unreleased items, sized S to L, non-returnable.</p>\n",
